   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d56e4dfd-3fd8-40ed-b03d-0ddcd9f53f06"],
 " without a connection is the least angle over the list."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"18c32d62-d005-4400-b800-40e89586b014"],

Cell["\<\
The Levi-Civita realisations are listed in full, with no cap. A long walk \
through vertices with many directions can give many of them.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"78ad28b4-0644-4121-964e-59020bc3d464"],

Cell["Options of the Levi-Civita form:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"97250b92-001d-46f1-a8a1-42f39acd96df"],

